WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.358 --> 00:00:02.570
The wonderful thing about My Little Ponies

2
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:03.998
is they live forever!

3
00:00:03.998 --> 00:00:07.051
Whee! (cheery music)

4
00:00:07.051 --> 00:00:09.280
If only bronies did as well.

5
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.501
(heavy breathing)

6
00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:13.581
(Unknown Speaker) I'm a pony!

7
00:00:13.581 --> 00:00:16.164
(somber music)

8
00:00:17.621 --> 00:00:20.655
When it comes to burial options,

9
00:00:20.655 --> 00:00:23.387
only one choice makes sense for a lifelong brony:

10
00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:27.627
donate your body to the Brony Glue Factory!

11
00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.198
At the Brony Glue Factory,

12
00:00:29.198 --> 00:00:32.099
we honor your dedication to the world of make believe.

13
00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:34.627
While your spirit frolics in the meadows of equestria,

14
00:00:34.627 --> 00:00:36.998
your lifeless body joins dozens of other bronies

15
00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:38.539
in a brand new adventure.

16
00:00:38.539 --> 00:00:41.427
Your brony remains get dipped in a high temperature enzyme

17
00:00:41.427 --> 00:00:43.067
that dissolves your flesh and bones

18
00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:45.267
and renders you into a powerful adhesive.

19
00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:46.827
(glue pouring)

20
00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:48.118
The same adhesive that's used

21
00:00:48.118 --> 00:00:50.328
to make the next generation of My Little Pony toys,

22
00:00:50.328 --> 00:00:53.118
so you can literally be a part of them forever.

23
00:00:53.118 --> 00:00:56.145
Bro-nate your body to the Brony Glue Factory today!

24
00:00:56.145 --> 00:01:00.358 line:15%
♫ Your dreams come true, we get free glue.

25
00:01:00.358 --> 00:01:03.191
(audience laughs)

26
00:01:06.455 --> 00:01:07.705
That's right.

27
00:01:10.873 --> 00:01:12.189
That's right. That guy died.

28
00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:13.206
All right.

29
00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.373
(laughs)

